bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Notification Page" as UI
boundary Router
control NotificationController
control NotificationService
entity ":NotificationModel" as NotificationModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click "Delete notification"
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. DELETE /api/notification/delete-noti/{id}
activate Router

Router -> NotificationController: 3. deleteNoti(id)
activate NotificationController

NotificationController -> NotificationService: 4. deleteNoti(id, payload)
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> NotificationService: 5. Check user
activate NotificationService
space
deactivate NotificationService

opt Invalid user
  NotificationService --> NotificationController: 5.1. BadRequestException
  NotificationController --> Router: 5.2. HTTP error
  Router --> UI: 5.3. Show error
  UI --> User: 5.4. Show error
end

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: 6. findOneAndDelete(_id, receiver_id)
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> MongoDB: 7. delete notification
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> NotificationModel: 8. delete result
deactivate MongoDB
NotificationModel --> NotificationService: 9. return deleted notification
deactivate NotificationModel

NotificationService --> NotificationController: 10. success result
deactivate NotificationService

NotificationController --> Router: 11. HTTP response
deactivate NotificationController

Router --> UI: 12. Response data
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 13. Remove notification from list
deactivate UI
deactivate User